{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "95", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "That's it from us then! Hope you enjoyed this thrilling series. Boy, had there been another Test, we could have had a series finale. After ups and downs neither team deserved to lose this series. The action won't stop here though as we have limited overs cricket now. First Pakistan will face Ireland for two ODIs and then will meet England again for five ODIs and one-off T20I. Do join us ahead for all the action. Until then, goodbye and take care. Cheers!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "94", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "England captain ALASTAIR COOK says it was a great series as both the sides played good cricket. Credits Pakistan for the way they played in this series. Adds they had an opportunity to win the series 3-1 but Pakistan came back hard. Feels Younis Khan's knock was a great one. Praises Jonny Bairstow for his form with the bat and Moeen Ali as well for scoring valuable runs. Adds they dropped crucial catches while fielding. Mentions it was a 50-50 call with the toss. Says it was swinging a bit but wasn't a minefield. He knows his top order has to add more runs if they want to be the number one side.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "93", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Pakistan's Man of the Series and their captain, MISBAH-UL-HAQ is pleased with the way the series had gone by. He credits the players for the way they fought back after the third Test. Adds a couple of bad sessions cost them the previous Test. He believed in his side to win this match and draw the series. He is happy that they've won on the fourth day itself. Credits England as they bat really deep and most of their contributions come from their lower order and they add quick runs. Credits Wahab Riaz for the run out and then dismissing Jonny Bairstow the very next ball as it was important at that stage. Adds when there is a lead then Yasir Shah plays a big role and he proved that by picking wickets yesterday. Mentions Younis Khan is a champion batsman and one can say him as an all time great. He keeps crediting his knock as it was under pressure. Adds age is not the factor and it's all about being mentally prepared. Says this side has given him a lot and they love to prove the critics wrong. When asked about whether he will be there for the Australia series, he says he will go back home and he'll think. Adds he'll have to think about his country when he'll plan his retirement. He thanks the supporters for rooting them throughout although they lost a couple of Tests. Feels this was a special win as they won it on their Independence Day and this win is a tribute for their great player Hanif Mohammad who passed away a couple of days back.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "92", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "England's Man of the Series, CHRIS WOAKES feels he had a good summer. Adds self belief is more important and that was crucial for his success. Adds he got his control back with the ball. Says Ben Stokes is a world class player and he has a great competition with him. Ends up by saying he had a couple of opportunities to get the big score with the bat but he couldn't do that.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "91", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Man of the Match, YOUNIS KHAN feels this is a special win as they've won against a top team. He adds his performance came at the right time as Pakistan needed him the most at that particular time. Adds when one is in a good position, he should always try to get a big lead. Says he likes to motivate the young and talented players in the squad and feels this was a team effort. Says the secret is he just looks to contribute with the bat and tries to get a century or a 150 or a double ton. Adds it was hard work and wasn't easy for him. Says Mohammad Azharuddin called him from India and asked him to stay in his crease and he was overwhelmed with that.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "90", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "The record stays as it is, Pakistan have never lost a series outside Asia after taking a 1-0 lead. Remember, they won the first Test but England came back hard in the second and third Test. The visitors had a point to prove and they answered their critics to win this Test here. They have a huge chance of becoming the number one Test team in the ICC rankings now if Australia lose their ongoing Test match against Sri Lanka and if India fail to win their final Test against West Indies. As of now, they will be ranked number three!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "89", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "England had a tough task with the bat in their second innings and they didn't get off to a good start once again. They lost four wickets yesterday itself. Bairstow and Ballance tried to rebuild but the Pakistani bowlers were good enough. Bairstow registered another fifty but it wasn't sufficient. Yasir Shah bowled beautifully in the third innings and got a 5-fer to restrict England on just 253. Pakistan were left to chase just 40 runs and they did it in style to win by 10 wickets.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "88", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "England opted to bat first and were under early pressure as their top order failed completely. Moeen Ali's century and some handy contributions from Jonny Bairstow and Chris Woakes guided England to a decent total. Sohail Khan was the star with the ball as he grabbed another 5-fer. In reply, Pakistan came back hard with the bat. Asad Shafiq hit a wonderful ton while the veteran Younis Khan smashed a marvelous double century. He was under pressure but as they say, you can't leave big players out of form for long and Younis did the same - answered with the bat and thus Pakistan got a healthy lead of 214 runs. Chris Woakes was the pick of bowlers once again as he grabbed a 3-fer.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "87", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "What a sensational effort by Pakistan here to win this Test match! THEY'VE DRAW THE SERIES 2-2!  They've wasted no time to chase down this small total here to silence their critics. Well played! Their batsmen walk back to the dressing room and get a standing ovation from their teammates. Superb all-round effort! Handshakes all around. Misbah-ul-Haq leads his troops as all the players shake hands with their opposition. The players pose for photographs. What a special win, this. Fitting how Pakistan have won this Test on their Independence day!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.1", "Id": "86", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "11678", "Commentary": "SIX! Pakistan have won in style and WIN THE TEST BY 10 WICKETS in a captivating manner! Floated well outside off, Ali extends his arms and hits it meatily over the long on boundary. That's a handsome shot and Ali pumps his fist in the air. The Pakistani dressing room is overwhelmed, there are big smiles on the faces of the Pakistani players and Mohammad Amir looks elated! Pakistan have thrashed England here!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.6", "Id": "85", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10129", "Batsman": "58200", "Commentary": "Full and floated up again Aslam pushes it to the covers.", "Summary": {"Score": "36/0", "Over": "13", "Runs": "0", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "58200", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "12", "Balls": "51", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "11678", "Runs": "24", "Balls": "27", "Fours": "4", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "10129", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "1", "Runs": "1", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.5", "Id": "84", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10129", "Batsman": "58200", "Commentary": "Defended off the front foot by the batsman presenting the full face of the bat.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.4", "Id": "83", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10129", "Batsman": "58200", "Commentary": "Tossed up and full, Aslam drives it sweetly to covers.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.3", "Id": "82", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10129", "Batsman": "58200", "Commentary": "Full ball, Aslam drives it to covers.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.2", "Id": "81", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10129", "Batsman": "58200", "Commentary": "NOT OUT! A little flatter on a length outside off, Aslam tries to cut it and misses and Bairstow collects it and flicks the bails in a flash. England have taken the review but Aslam seemed to be clearly inside the crease. The replays show that Aslam was a bit lazy in the crease and lifted his left foot for a while but put it in just at the nick of time.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "80", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Is there some twist in the tale? There is an appeal for a stumping which is referred upstairs...", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.1", "Id": "79", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10129", "Batsman": "58200", "Commentary": "Tossed up outside off, Aslam defends it solidly.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.6", "Id": "78", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "11678", "Commentary": "Flighted outside off, Azhar gets onto his front foot and defends.", "Summary": {"Score": "36/0", "Over": "12", "Runs": "8", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "11678", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "24", "Balls": "27", "Fours": "4", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "58200", "Runs": "12", "Balls": "45", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4688", "Overs": "5.4", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "24", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.5", "Id": "77", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "11678", "Commentary": "Landed around off, Azhar covers the line and defends.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.4", "Id": "76", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "11678", "Commentary": "FOUR! Another boundary! Landed outside off, Azhar plays it past the point region and gets yet another boundary. Pakistan are one hit away from a win here.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.3", "Id": "75", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "11678", "Commentary": "Full outside off, Azhar defends it from within his crease.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.2", "Id": "74", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "11678", "Commentary": "FOUR! Take that! Fullish on off, Azhar gets down on his knee and slogs it over mid-wicket. Just beats the fielder and gets a boundary. Looks like he won't hang around now.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.1", "Id": "73", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "11678", "Commentary": "Landed around off, Azhar defends it into the ground.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.6", "Id": "72", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10129", "Batsman": "58200", "Commentary": "Arm ball on off. Aslam prods forward in defence.", "Summary": {"Score": "28/0", "Over": "11", "Runs": "0", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "58200", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "12", "Balls": "45", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "11678", "Runs": "16", "Balls": "21", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "10129", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "1", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.5", "Id": "71", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10129", "Batsman": "58200", "Commentary": "Wide of off, spinning away. Aslam lets it go.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.4", "Id": "70", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10129", "Batsman": "58200", "Commentary": "Aslam lunges across in defence.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.3", "Id": "69", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10129", "Batsman": "58200", "Commentary": "Quicker, sliding on outside off. Aslam leaves it alone.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.2", "Id": "68", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10129", "Batsman": "58200", "Commentary": "Full delivery, Aslam drives it firmly to the covers.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.1", "Id": "67", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10129", "Batsman": "58200", "Commentary": "Full delivery, Aslam defends it to point.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.6", "Id": "66", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "11678", "Commentary": "The batsman has defended it by getting right behind the line of the delivery.", "Summary": {"Score": "28/0", "Over": "10", "Runs": "10", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "11678", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "16", "Balls": "21", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "58200", "Runs": "12", "Balls": "39", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4688", "Overs": "4.4", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "16", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.5", "Id": "65", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "11678", "Commentary": "FOUR! Outside off, Ali tries to square drive it but gets a thick outside edge and races to the third man boundary!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.4", "Id": "64", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "58200", "Commentary": "Sliding into middle and leg, tucked behind square leg for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.3", "Id": "63", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "58200", "Commentary": "FOUR! Loopy delivery, Aslam gets down on one knee and goes for a full fledged sweep but gets a top edge which flies towards fine leg and reaches the boundary!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.2", "Id": "62", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "58200", "Commentary": "Aslam prods forward in defence.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.1", "Id": "61", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "11678", "Commentary": "Tossed up ball outside off, Ali steps down the track and drives it through the covers for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.6", "Id": "60", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10129", "Batsman": "58200", "Commentary": "Tossed up, Aslam is compact in his defence.", "Summary": {"Score": "18/0", "Over": "9", "Runs": "1", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "58200", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "7", "Balls": "36", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "11678", "Runs": "11", "Balls": "18", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "10129", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "1", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}